# Local ports:
#   ApiGateway:     http://localhost:5172
#   Orders:         http://localhost:5180
#   Notifications:  http://localhost:5181
#
# Prefer VS Code/Cursor compound launch "All Services", or start all three projects first.

@ApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5172

### Create order via gateway (Orders also notifies Notifications)
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
X-Correlation-ID: {{$guid}}

{
  "customerName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "amount": 42.50
}

###

### List orders via gateway
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### List notifications via gateway (includes side-effect from order create)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications
Accept: application/json

###

### Create notification directly via gateway
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{$guid}}

{
  "orderId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "message": "Manual reminder",
  "recipient": "ops@example.com"
}

###
